   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **banter/PA Feedback**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Billy Story**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Old Swinging Bridge**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **My Love Come Rolling Down**: back after 87 archived shows (450 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-09-22** (recommended): source not stated; 27 songs; 177 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Vince Herman on guitar and Drew Emmitt on mandolin, both of Leftover Salmon, joined Billy; Emmitt sang lead on one song [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-09-22**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Beyerdynamic mc 930's [1]. Also: Recorded with Beyerdynamic MC 930 mics in ORTF, through Mogami cables into a Zoom H8 at 24-bit/48k; taped and transferred by discocape [1]",
